<h2>Summerville claim questions</h2><div class="faq"><details><summary>Is earthquake damage covered under my Summerville homeowners policy?</summary><div class="a"><p>Usually not, unless you added an earthquake endorsement or bought a separate policy. Check your declarations page, and talk with your agent if you are unsure what you have.</p></div></details><details><summary>My builder’s siding color is discontinued. Will the insurer replace the whole wall?</summary><div class="a"><p>It depends on the policy language and how visible the mismatch is. We document the original product and the closest available match so the question can be decided on evidence.</p></div></details><details><summary>Does it matter which county my Summerville home is in?</summary><div class="a"><p>The policy terms are the same, but permitting, code requirements and flood mapping can differ between Dorchester, Berkeley and Charleston Counties, and those can affect the repair scope.</p></div></details></div>
